WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.939 --> 00:00:19.868
New Year's Day is in January.

2
00:00:19.869 --> 00:00:24.413
"Happy New Year!"

3
00:00:24.414 --> 00:00:35.694
Valentine's Day is in February.

4
00:00:35.695 --> 00:00:40.153
"Will you be my valentine?"

5
00:00:40.154 --> 00:00:46.778
St. Patrick's Day is in March.

6
00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:52.458
"Happy St. Patrick's Day!"

7
00:00:52.459 --> 00:01:06.711
April Fool's Day is in April.

8
00:01:06.712 --> 00:01:12.083
"Ha-ha-ha, April fool!"

9
00:01:12.084 --> 00:01:21.096
Mother's Day is in May.

10
00:01:21.097 --> 00:01:26.374
"Mommy, we love you."

11
00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:31.012
Father's Day is in June.

12
00:01:31.013 --> 00:01:36.826
"Daddy, we love you."

13
00:01:36.827 --> 00:01:43.959
The American Independence Day is in July.

14
00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:50.320
"Wow! Fireworks!"

15
00:01:50.321 --> 00:01:57.129
My birthday is in August.

16
00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:01.047
"Happy birthday!"

17
00:02:01.048 --> 00:02:07.843
School begins in September.

18
00:02:07.844 --> 00:02:12.376
"Good morning, Mrs. Wood."

19
00:02:12.377 --> 00:02:21.107
Halloween is in October.

20
00:02:21.108 --> 00:02:28.949
"Trick or treat."

21
00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:35.793
Thanksgiving is in November.

22
00:02:35.794 --> 00:02:44.317
"Please pass the turkey."

23
00:02:44.318 --> 00:02:53.043
Christmas is in December.

24
00:02:53.044 --> 00:02:59.271
"Merry Christmas, everyone!"
